OL,3,GNEWSAThree arrested for conspiracy to
OL,4,Amurder after shooting
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo teenagers and a man have been
OL,7,Farrested after a shotgun was fired in a
OL,8,Ftown centre.
OL,10,FPolice were called to Market Place in
OL,11,FBraintree at about 22:10 BST on Monday
OL,12,Ffollowing what they described as a
OL,13,F"targeted attack".
OL,15,FTwo teenage boys sustained serious but
OL,16,Fnot life-threatening injuries to their
OL,17,Fface and upper body after the shooting
OL,18,Finvolving two groups, Essex Police
OL,19,Fsaid.
